<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear>, Wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Insonders</unclear> guot Fründt und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear>
